  "preparation_tips": [
    "Focus on Basic Science & Mathematics (30 marks) - cover all topics thoroughly",
    "Practice Data Analysis & Interpretation (30 marks) with charts, graphs, tables",
    "Logical Capability (20 marks) - practice syllogism, blood relations, puzzles, RC passages",
    "Mental Reasoning (20 marks) - analogy, series, coding-decoding, ranking",
    "Solve previous year papers (2016, 2025, 2026) under timed conditions",
    "Take mock tests regularly to improve speed and accuracy",
    "Follow 90-day study plan for systematic preparation",
    "Revise regularly - weekly revision of covered topics",
    "Focus on weak areas identified through mock test analysis",
    "Plan for 120 minutes: about 72 seconds per question, with 1/3 mark lost per wrong answer."
  ],
